          "text": "난 잠들었어",
          "next": [
            202130003
          ]
        },
        "202130003": {
          "id": 202130003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "썰렁하네",
          "next": [
            202130005
          ]
        },
        "202130004": {
          "id": 202130004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "나도 잠이 안 와",
          "next": [
            202130005
          ]
        },
        "202130005": {
          "id": 202130005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "흠, 사실 방금 영화를 봤어",
          "next": [
            202130006
          ]
        },
        "202130006": {
          "id": 202130006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "실화를 각색한 건데, 세상에서 20개가 넘는 인격을 가진 사람의 이야기야……",
          "next": [
            202130007
          ]
        },
        "202130007": {
          "id": 202130007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "주인공도 기억에 공백이 생겼어. 단순히 기억을 잃은 줄 알았지만, 사실은 다른 인격이 주인공 대신 삶을 이어가고 있었던 거였지",
          "next": [
            202130008
          ]
        },
        "202130008": {
          "id": 202130008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "혹시 나도 그런 걸까……",
          "next": [
            202130009
          ]
        },
        "202130009": {
          "id": 202130009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202130010,
            202130013
          ]
        },
        "202130010": {
          "id": 202130010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "사실… 네 생각이 맞아……",
          "next": [
            202130011
          ]
        },
        "202130011": {
          "id": 202130011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "사실… 어제의 넌… 오늘의 너와는 달라…. 어제의 네가… 더 귀여웠어……",
          "next": [
            202130012
          ]
        },
        "202130012": {
          "id": 202130012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "말 좀 똑바로 해! 난 오늘도 귀엽고, 내일은 더 귀여울 거라고!",
          "next": [
            202130014
          ]
        },
        "202130013": {
          "id": 202130013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "안심해, 난 신의 시점으로 보잖아. 넌 완벽한 네 모습 그대로야",
          "next": [
            202130014
          ]
        },
        "202130014": {
          "id": 202130014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "넌 농담처럼 말하지만, 난 좀 걱정돼",
          "next": [
            202130015
          ]
        },
        "202130015": {
          "id": 202130015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "혹시… 다른 Mar. 7th가 더 있는 건 아닐까!",
          "next": [
            202130016
          ]
        },
        "202130016": {
          "id": 202130016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "어쩌면… 성격이 괴팍한 예술가 Mar. 7th라든가? 아니면 사교적이고 우아한 킬러 Mar. 7th라든가, 무서워……",
          "next": [
            202130017
          ]
        },
        "202130017": {
          "id": 202130017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "설마 똑똑한 천재 Mar. 7th가 있진 않겠지……",
          "next": [
            202130018,
            202130020,
            202130022
          ]
        },
        "202130018": {
          "id": 202130018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "알겠다. 지금은 환상에 빠질 시간이네, 자야겠다",
          "next": [
            202130019
          ]
        },
        "202130019": {
          "id": 202130019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "잠에서 깨어나도 넌 여전히 귀엽고 따뜻하고 착하고 천진난만한 미소녀 Mar. 7th야",
          "next": [
            202130024
          ]
        },
        "202130020": {
          "id": 202130020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "잊지 마, 넌 여전히 은하열차 검술의 일인자 Mar. 7th야",
          "next": [
            202130021
          ]
        },
        "202130021": {
          "id": 202130021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "걱정 마, 넌 여전히 귀엽고 따뜻하고 착하고 천진난만한 미소녀 Mar. 7th야",
          "next": [
            202130024
          ]
        },
        "202130022": {
          "id": 202130022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "걱정 마, 괜찮을 거야",
          "next": [
            202130023
          ]
        },
        "202130023": {
          "id": 202130023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "네가 그 귀엽고 따뜻하고 착하고 천진난만한 미소녀 Mar. 7th구나",
          "next": [
            202130024
          ]
        },
        "202130024": {
          "id": 202130024,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "next": [
            202130025
          ]
        },
        "202130025": {
          "id": 202130025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "역시 넌 말을 참 잘한다니까……",
          "next": [
            202130026
          ]
        },
        "202130026": {
          "id": 202130026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "그래, 솔직히 난 그렇게까지 신경 쓰지 않아",
          "next": [
            202130027
          ]
        },
        "202130027": {
          "id": 202130027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "내가 바로 그 사교성 넘치고, 착한 일을 많이 하고, 지혜롭고, 매력적이고, 영리한 데다 귀엽고 따뜻하고 착하고 천진난만한 미소녀 Mar. 7th니까!",
          "next": [
            202130028
          ]
        },
        "202130028": {
          "id": 202130028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1001,
          "text": "얼른 자, {NICKNAME}",
          "next": [
            202130029
          ]
        },
        "202130029": {
